let __v_249 = Value::from("Drop bars put your hands in three or four positions, which is what makes them comfortable on a long ride, and they drop your chest for less wind; flat bars give more control and a better view in traffic, and are the right answer for a town bike. If you ride for an hour or more on open roads, drops are worth the getting used to; if your rides are short or in traffic, flat bars with bar ends are the easier choice. Width matters as much as shape: about as wide as your shoulders, and a little wider for control off road.");
